      ],
      "content": "\\begin{array}{r c l} V _ {R E F} & = & \\text {The reference voltage} = V _ {D D} \\text {in the} \\\\ & & \\text {MCP4725. This V_{REF} is the ideal} \\\\ & & \\text {full scale voltage range} \\\\ n & = & \\text {The number of digital input bits.} \\\\ & & (n = 1 2 \\text {for MCP4725}) \\end{array}"
    },
